WEBVTT

00:00:01.670 --> 00:00:04.120
As long as justice exists in this world,

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:06.620
(Narrate by Ryousuke Kaizu)
evil would still remain.

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:09.420
Behind the war between justice and evil,

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:12.170
there is a group of unknown warriors.

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:17.880
(Monster Development Department of Agastia
Touka Kuroistu, Assistant)

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:20.580
Wake up, Blade!

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.960
(Hydra, Regenerated Monster)
Within the attack range of Hydra,

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:24.710
you have no way to escape.

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:28.540
Hydra, the regenerated monster,

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:30.960
(The Prediction of Hydra's' Final Product)
She's equipped with eight subheads.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.580
Originally, she was designed in this way.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.210
But, due to the tight submission,
we could only make one.

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.120
Besides, she possesses venom.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:39.460
Originally, she was designed in this way.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:42.080
But, due to insufficient budget,
we didn't install it.

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:48.000
Don't ever think that I'll retreat.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.250
I'll attack with all my might
from the beginning.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:53.420
What a strong spirit.

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.880
Blade is very different today.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:58.540
I need to be faster.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:01.170
If I don't defeat her quickly,

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:03.540
I'll be late for work.

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:05.120
Kenshin Blade

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:09.040
works every Wednesday and Saturday night.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:24.330
