♫Live within the current power♫

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:34.420
♫Special force♫

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:40.580
(Miss Kuroitsu from the Monster Development Department)
♫Special force♫

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:46.000
♫Everyone possesses this power (Power)♫

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.710
♫Being locked up without realising it♫

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.080
♫You are the courageous flower (Flower)♫

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:53.830
♫Fighting against with nonsense today♫

00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:56.000
♫Warfare against the sleepiness
in the morning♫

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.710
♫Psychological warfare begins at forenoon,
bringing the project to the meeting♫

00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:02.460
♫Don't lose. You'll be fine♫

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:04.380
♫It's gonna be ok!!♫

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:06.960
♫The hardworking one deserves respect♫

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.460
♫You'll be rewarded one day♫

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:12.380
♫Wake up and believe in this power. Do it again♫

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:15.540
♫Everyone is special. Only one, Let's go!!♫

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:18.960
♫Keep striving to march forward
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:21.420
♫Grit your teeth and endure it
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:26.210
♫Persistence empowers you.
The important special force♫

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:29.710
♫Keep striving to march forward today
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:32.420
♫Grit your teeth and endure it
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:35.040
♫Keep it up. Stronger♫

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:38.920
♫With your beautiful special force♫

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:41.500
(Episode 3: A Monster Who Traps
In the Cycle of Death and Rebirth)

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:43.000
(Struggles to Resist This Shackle
Until Tempted by a Soul Who's Bounded by Fate)

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:58.830
Hello.

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:01.880
Miss Mizuki, Matsuyama speaking.

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:04.750
I'm the person in charge
of the employee shuttle.

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:10.710
Thank you so much for the last few days.

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:12.790
Are you free tomorrow, Miss Mizuki?

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:15.380
We are lack of manpower.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.710
Is it the same working place?

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:21.210
Any problem with that?

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:23.290
Not really.

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:26.960
But I'm not suitable for that kind of work.

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:29.120
True.

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:32.040
Perhaps that place is not suitable
for Miss Mizuki.

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:33.790
I'm thinking of that too.

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:35.120
Right?

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:37.790
But, it's a new working place this time.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:39.960
Meaning to say, it's a relaxing job instead.

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:42.500
Besides, meal is provided as well.

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.000
It's a deluxe seafood meal.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:48.960
Are you able to make it?

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.750
(Aladdin Bento)

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:56.120
What a pickle.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:00.670
Fortunately, I managed to catch up
with the working hours today.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:03.460
But, I can't have more shifts.

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:08.620
It's not easy to be the hero of justice
and take part-time job simultaneously.

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:11.710
Two of them performed really well today.

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:12.880
Of course.

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:15.170
The righteous Magical Girls, Rose Grass

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:17.580
would never lose to villains.

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:20.250
(Rose Grass, the Magical Girls)
We'll secure this city.

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:23.210
Are they the recognised heroes, Magical Girls?

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:24.330
I really envy them.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.830
Full-time hero can be used as their resume,

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:29.080
they could receive sponsors too.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.540
Making them into anime movies,

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:32.080
selling merchandise,

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.710
producing game consoles,

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:35.670
and also 2.5D.

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:37.250
That's awesome.

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:43.250
However, there's all news about Magical Girls
recently.

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:46.290
Henshin Hero isn't popular now?

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:50.380
Is it okay that I continue to be Blade?

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:52.710
Welcome.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.460
I want a pork rice bowl.

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:01.380
May I have two sets of pickled ginger as well?

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:03.790
One pork rice bowl.

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:05.460
Just get off work now?

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:07.790
You seem tired.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:12.210
Because the work didn't progress smoothly.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:14.040
Didn't progress smoothly?

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:16.540
Is it the job she couldn't tell?

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.830
What the heck? Why so little money?

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:26.790
I'm sorry. No one has booked me.

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:28.580
No! That's for the electric bill...

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:32.080
Quiet! Bring me more money then.

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:36.830
Such a scumbag.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:38.620
Though I've tried my best,

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:40.380
however, due to budget and time constraints,

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:42.750
the progress is still lacking.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:43.880
Progress?

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:46.330
Kenshin Blade, Kenji Sadamaki

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:48.790
has misunderstood Kuroitsu's profession.

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:52.580
Although I have confidence in the project,

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.500
however, the result is below expectation.

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:56.880
I understood.

00:05:56.880 --> 00:06:01.250
Because I'm having trouble with my work as well.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:05.290
I'm clueless about whether I'm doing it right.

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:08.460
As a layman, I'm not clear about your job.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.920
It seems your work is hectic too.

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:11.830
True.

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:14.750
However, it's my decision.

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:17.420
I won't compromise.

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:18.960
Compromise...

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:23.210
I've been too zealous
about completing the project.

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:24.880
I must have compromised in some parts of it.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.250
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:28.380
It's your order.

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:31.670
Mr. Shopkeeper, thank you for the advice.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:35.620
I'll challenge it again.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:39.080
That's great. You can do it.

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:42.000
Wake up, Blade!

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:46.120
The combat ability of the redesigned Hydra
is two times higher than before.

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:49.000
(New Hydra, the Double-regenerated Monster)

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:52.500
It's a regenerated monster
with two new subheads.

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:54.920
-It's going to add in venom a few days later...
-Blade Crush!

00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:01.330
(Aladdin Bento)
I really can't stand those guys from Agastia.

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:04.120
Why do they always show up on Saturdays?

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:06.960
I'd be late for work.

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:13.120
I can't work two jobs at the same time, can I?

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:15.420
It's impossible.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:18.670
Leave it to us, we'll secure the city.

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:21.710
If so, you can be Miracle Rose.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:24.620
The Magical World will never lose.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:29.000
DX Magical Wand! DX Magical Case!

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:31.620
It's on sale at Papinia.

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:35.670
Maybe I can't do it.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:42.080
A smaller portion of a pork rice bowl.

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:45.420
Besides, please give me
three sets of pickled ginger.

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:48.960
You look more tired than last time.

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:51.710
I planned to look up the past material.

00:07:51.710 --> 00:07:55.040
But, the old information isn't digitalised.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:58.170
In the end, I still lost to
budget and submission.

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:01.210
I couldn't make use of the original idea.

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:05.830
Even myself isn't satisfied
with the final product of Hydra.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.710
I'm sorry, Miss Kuroitsu.

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:10.540
It's my fault to lose to Blade.

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:13.960
That's right. We were beaten up so hard.

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:17.120
The feeling of claiming ourselves a Hydra
yet we only have three heads,

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:18.960
have you ever thought for us?

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:22.790
Elder Sister, Second Sister, quit saying.

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:24.460
(Monster Development Department of Agastia)
At least we've completed one task.

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:26.880
(Wolf Bete, Novice Assistant)
Hope that you could treat us to a meal in cafe.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:30.670
I prefer to go to a beer bar
in Ginza or Akasaka.

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:34.080
Do you really want to add more of these?

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.000
They're noisy.

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.960
Shut up, you bisexual monster.

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:39.170
What did you say?

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:42.000
Elder Sister, Second Sister.

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:45.290
It didn't go well.

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.830
The initial design idea

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:53.210
is to freeze Blade with venom

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:55.880
and the heads will launch attacks
in undulations.

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:59.000
Surrounding him and then launching focus attacks

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:02.830
can't be achieved by only two heads.

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:07.170
I must find a way to get an extra budget.

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:12.120
Are you all right?

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:16.620
Sorry. I'm fine.

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:20.540
Are you going to bring this heavy thing home?

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:23.880
It's for work purposes.

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:26.540
Your work is really tough.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:30.330
For some reason, it's for my work.

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:32.040
But, apart from this,

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:34.710
I have a personal goal that I must accomplish.

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:38.830
One can't forget about their initial wish.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:41.540
Initial wish...

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:45.000
Right. Helping people in need

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.420
is my reason to be Kenshin Blade.

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:50.580
How could I compromise first?

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:56.040
Thank you for the advice, Miss.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:00.960
I seem to have forgotten my initial wish.

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:04.620
I realise that I must get back
something important.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.710
That's great.

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.120
Let's strive for our own goals.

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:11.330
(Aladdin Bento)
Thank you.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.880
What a serious shopkeeper.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:18.420
I should be on par with him.
I must redraw the plan.

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:22.210
That's right.
My goal is to defeat Kenshin Blade.

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:25.960
I'll eliminate him.

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:31.120
Right now, at this moment,
your end is nearing.

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:37.790
The genuine Hydra, the triple-generated monster.

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:41.830
It's a regenerated monster
with two times the head's number.

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:43.750
They've spent all budget on this.

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:47.500
So, it's a pity that the venom isn't added in.

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:49.710
Hateful Agastia.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:52.460
Why do they come on Saturday again?

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:54.000
Come on, Blade!

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:56.380
Your rival is as tough as you.

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:03.420
You'll handle the rest.

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:09.750
Isn't it the same working place as last time?

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:11.170
No.

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:15.750
It was Secret Society Evil of Kyushu company.

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:18.000
It's Hokkaido's now.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:22.040
The organisation belongs to Shadow Emperor,
Ferdous from King of Dark Woods.

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:24.210
It's a different organisation.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.500
Here he is.

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:32.880
The knight from the northern jungle.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:35.120
Wearing in the moonlight
that pierces through the darkness.

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:37.380
Kant, The Owl Knight.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:41.710
Well, it's time for the darkness to return.

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:46.460
Let's go.

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:48.880
I...

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:53.210
It's not relaxing work at all.

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:56.580
(Hydra, the Regenerated Monster)

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:02.500
I have a question for you.

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:06.330
The reason why our company skipped
the written resume before the interview

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:11.120
is because President attaches great importance
to face-to-face conversation.

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:14.120
While you're...

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:19.120
wearing a mascot suit to the interview
as you think it's the appropriate attire.

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:20.670
(Canon Thunderbird)
Am I right?

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:24.830
(Long Range Sniper Special Monster)
No, it's not a mascot. It's my body.

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:26.580
It means that you're naked now?

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:28.920
I have a tie.

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:31.790
I see. Wearing tie nakedly.

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:37.620
Do you know our enterprise highly values
new technology?

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:39.420
Yes, I do.

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:41.960
Your technology has greatly contributed
to society.

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:43.920
It amazes me.

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:48.830
What skills do you have
that are contributive to our company?

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:50.960
My skill

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:53.210
is to eliminate heroes and launch attacks.

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:56.790
Do you mean killing?

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:00.710
To be frank, it is.

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.750
I can kill anyone.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.710
I see.

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:10.380
(Unsuccessful Application Notice)

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:13.290
No congratulatory message for admission?

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:16.000
As expected, it didn't work.

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:17.960
Even if I've changed my job,

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:21.750
I'm still a monster, a truth can't be changed.

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:26.080
I knew it's just a futile struggle.

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:28.420
-Whenever I think of staying in the society
-Do you want a balloon?

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:29.830
-for decades, I started to ponder
-Balloons are fun.

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:35.040
whether it's a path I want. I've begun to worry.

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:37.580
Thank you, safe trip.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:43.460
But, I could only be a tour guide
in the theme park

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:47.960
in one of the surface enterprises of Agastia.

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:52.040
It's for you, little girl. It's a balloon.

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:56.460
Thank you, pink is my favourite colour.

00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:59.500
I see. It's great that you like it.

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:01.790
I got to go, cute Mr. Bird.

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.000
Thank you.

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:08.960
It's great, Reo.

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.250
What?

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:15.710
Did the bird think that I'm at the age
of being happy if I got a balloon?

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.580
You too, Yuto.

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:22.000
Do you think you could win my heart
with a balloon?

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:24.080
I didn't think of that, Reo.

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:28.330
It's the mascot that made me look small
as it's huge.

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:32.960
Anyway, you still treat me like a kid.

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:36.210
I'm so envious of you. Yuto, you're tall.

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:40.040
Reo, you'd better not cling on to me.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:43.920
The classmates will misunderstand us
if they see it.

00:14:43.920 --> 00:14:45.500
What can I do?

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:48.830
The headquarter always asks us to team up
for actions.

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:52.540
You're right though, but it's not necessary
to stand so close.

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:01.710
A monster is detected...

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:02.790
Yuto.

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:07.710
Magic Blast!

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:12.290
Reo Shikishima and Yuto Higaya
are not ordinary high school students.

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:16.250
They protect the city

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:17.830
and are officially recognised
as the heroes of justice.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:20.830
Magical Girls, Rose Grass.

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:05.000
Miracle Rose, Magical Girl.

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:13.120
Miracle Grass, Magical Girl.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:21.250
Previously, I've been thinking about it.

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:25.540
You seem shorter than me
after the transformation.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:26.960
I think so.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:29.540
My eye level has become lower.

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:33.670
What's wrong?

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:36.330
Although you're shorter,

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:40.540
what's wrong with the size?

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:44.580
Though it seems you don't have interest in it,
you're obsessed with big boobs, aren't you?

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:49.500
-I can't control my body though.
-How dare you Yuto...

00:16:57.620 --> 00:16:59.880
Well, get ready.

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:01.120
Let's go, Yuto.

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.540
Let's get the hateful monster and eliminate it.

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:06.080
Eliminate it.

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:10.210
Reo's emotion is rather temperamental.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:14.000
Elder Sister, Third Sister, don't fight.

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:16.830
It was her who said something ridiculous.

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:21.540
Elder Sister said everyone can be
the action star as long as the person is pretty.

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.500
I'm telling the truth.

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:26.040
They're all depending on stunt performers
and Computer Graphics.

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:27.250
Are you joking?

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:30.330
How could those superficial actors
hang on a transport plane which's ready to fly?

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:32.330
A group of troublesome brats.

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:34.500
If the movie screenplay isn't good,

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:35.620
everything is just rubbish.

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:39.380
I think the new Snow Doll
sings better than before.

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:41.210
Shut your mouth.

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:43.880
Sisters, your temperamental emotions

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:46.580
will be detected by the heroes.

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:48.290
It's the monster.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:49.790
We got it.

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:52.380
Settle it in one go, Grass.

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:54.170
Let's attack, Rose.

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:58.380
Magic Blast!

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.460
I, born as a monster,

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:05.500
have no idea about
life apart from the monster's way.

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:06.880
Am I dignified

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:10.170
to be a monster?

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:23.960
She has dodged.

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:26.580
What? This brat.

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:31.580
Sisters, are you all right?

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:33.290
You run first, Matsu.

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:35.080
These brats are good at long-range attacks.

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:37.330
They're quite a hard nut to crack.

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:41.620
Don't think of running away.

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:43.670
Spiked Rose!

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:50.880
Many people are intolerant
of the existence of monsters.

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:55.170
That's because we're all created
for the same purpose.

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:59.790
But, as Miss Kuroitsu's creation,
my design isn't meticulous.

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:02.170
Therefore, I possess diverse traits.

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:05.500
On the contrary, I'm lost now.

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:07.250
Yes, I'm lost.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:10.960
Perhaps the reason why I could make a decision
is because of this.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:16.380
If so, I'll choose my own path
and march forward on it.

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:24.330
Are you all right, Matsu?

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:25.580
Pull yourself together.

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:29.500
Great. Finish her.

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:40.000
What's this brat doing?

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:41.620
He's not a mascot,

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:43.210
but a monster.

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:47.080
I'm just her colleague.

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.920
He's fast.

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:55.210
Don't ever think that you can escape,
fatty bird.

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:00.460
Spiked ro...

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:09.880
Rose!

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:14.460
Are you all right, Rose?

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:23.170
Thunder Charging System,
Great Speed launches now!

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:24.580
It's bad!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:33.500
Are you all right, Rose?

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:41.420
I can't believe

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:44.210
that I've lost.

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:49.670
Rose.

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:56.620
Why does the bird possess that kind of power?

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.880
It's ridiculous.

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:05.920
No worries, you're a strong girl.

00:21:05.920 --> 00:21:10.710
I still believe that you're strong
even if you've lost.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:14.380
Yuto!

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:18.210
Sorry, Yuto. I was too impatient.

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:20.580
As long as you're fine, Rose.

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:25.080
However, don't call my real name
during the transformation.

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:30.120
(Miss Kuroitsu
From the Monster Development Department)

